      <section class="ent-sec" aria-labelledby="flow-h">
        <h2 class="ent-eyebrow" id="flow-h">One workspace</h2>
        <h3 class="ent-h">Chat, collaborate, build and review, across all your data sources, without leaving OpenShore.</h3>
        <p class="ent-body">Work starts as a conversation and stays in one place from the first question to the finished report. Everything draws on the apps you have connected, and a person approves before anything moves.</p>
        <ol class="ent-flow" role="list">
          <li>
            <div class="ent-flow-t"><span class="ent-step">Chat to project</span><h4>A chat becomes a project.</h4><p>Chat with the model, bring in a teammate or an agent, then turn the chat into a project. It sets up the members, milestones, tasks and sources from what the chat already knows.</p></div>
            <img src="/enterprise/flow/chat-to-project.jpg" alt="A chat called Shelf reset plan beside the new project it sets up, Cedar Grove retail launch, with its name, members, milestones, tasks and sources filled in." width="1600" height="805" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          </li>
          <li>
            <div class="ent-flow-t"><span class="ent-step">Task to workflow</span><h4>A task becomes a workflow.</h4><p>The plan becomes tasks with owners and dates. Put an agent on a task and watch it work. When the work repeats, the model drafts a workflow, and nothing runs until a person confirms it.</p></div>
            <img src="/enterprise/flow/task-to-workflow.jpg" alt="A project's task list with owners and weeks, beside a drafted weekly restock workflow that waits for a person to confirm it." width="1600" height="758" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          </li>
          <li>
            <div class="ent-flow-t"><span class="ent-step">Report to dashboard</span><h4>A report becomes a dashboard.</h4><p>Each run feeds a report. When a report keeps coming, the model offers a dashboard that stays current, and every number opens to its source.</p></div>
            <img src="/enterprise/flow/report.jpg" alt="A weekly restock report with a summary and a sell-through chart, and an offer to make it a dashboard." width="1600" height="839" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
            <img src="/enterprise/flow/dashboard.jpg" alt="The dashboard it becomes, with sell-through, units on shelf, weeks of stock, order value, approved reorders and quota attainment." width="1600" height="819" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          </li>
        </ol>
        <p class="ent-note">Screens from the product tour above, with example data.</p>
